@startuml Role-Based Configuration System
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam handwritten false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

title Role-Based Configuration System\n(Agent/Model Assignment for Orchestrated Tasks)

package "Configuration Models" {
  class RoleAgentConfig {
    +agent: str = "react"
    +model: Optional[str]
    +attempts: Optional[int]
    +submit: Optional[bool]
    +kwargs: Dict[str, Any]
    +description: Optional[str]
    +tools: Optional[List[str]]
    +timeout: Optional[int]
  }

  class RoleBasedConfig {
    +roles: Dict[str, RoleAgentConfig]
    +defaults: Optional[RoleAgentConfig]
    --
    +get_config_for_role(role: str): RoleAgentConfig
    +to_agent_assignments(): List[AgentAssignment]
  }

  RoleBasedConfig *-- "0..*" RoleAgentConfig : roles
  RoleBasedConfig *-- "0..1" RoleAgentConfig : defaults
}

package "Example 1: CTI-REALM Dual-Role Configuration" {
  object "roles.yaml" as Config1 {
    **roles:**
      red:
        agent: "react"
        model: "gpt-4"
        attempts: 3
      blue:
        agent: "cot"
        model: "claude-3-opus"
        attempts: 2

    **defaults:**
      agent: "react"
      model: "gpt-4o-mini"
      attempts: 1
  }

  note bottom of Config1
    **Usage:**
    inspect eval saber_task \\
      --roles roles.yaml

    **Result:**
    - Red episodes use GPT-4 (3 attempts)
    - Blue episodes use Claude-3 (2 attempts)
    - Other roles use defaults
  end note
}

package "Example 2: Override via CLI" {
  object "base_config.yaml" as Base {
    **roles:**
      attacker:
        agent: "react"
        model: "gpt-4"
      defender:
        agent: "react"
        model: "gpt-4"
  }

  object "CLI Override" as CLI {
    --model "gpt-4-turbo"
    --attacker_model "claude-3-opus"
    --attacker_attempts 5
  }

  object "Merged Config" as Merged {
    **roles:**
      attacker:
        agent: "react"
        model: "claude-3-opus"  ← overridden
        attempts: 5  ← overridden
      defender:
        agent: "react"
        model: "gpt-4-turbo"  ← global override
        attempts: 1  ← default
  }

  Base --> Merged : +
  CLI --> Merged : =

  note bottom of Merged
    **Merge Priority (in get_config_for_role):**
    1. Role-specific config fields (highest)
    2. Default config fields
    3. RoleAgentConfig defaults (agent="react")

    Note: kwargs are merged, not replaced
  end note
}

note as ConfigFlow
  **Configuration Loading Flow**
  (saber/client/config_loader.py)

  1. User loads configuration:
     RoleConfigLoader.load(source)

  2. Source can be:
     - Dict → direct Python dict
     - Path → file path
     - String starting with '{' → inline JSON
     - String → file path (YAML/JSON)

  3. Parse and validate:
     - validate_role_names() - ensure valid role names
     - validate_has_configuration() - ensure roles or defaults exist

  4. Get config for specific role:
     get_config_for_role(role) merges:
     - defaults.dict(exclude_unset=True)
     - role_config.dict(exclude_unset=True)
     - kwargs are merged (dict merge, not replace)

  5. Convert to AgentAssignment list:
     to_agent_assignments() creates one assignment per role
end note

@enduml
